o-block-between-text shortcuts-info-artboard-text">To activate Shortcuts, you need to switch the Active Control toggle to the &quot;on&quot; position using a pin or any other object.</div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="shortcuts-info-block shortcuts-info-block-info shortcuts-info-block-between"><div class="shortcuts-info-block-between-image shortcuts-info-info-image"><div class="icon  "><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#x27;40&#x27;%20height=&#x27;40&#x27;%20viewBox=&#x27;0%200%2040%2040&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;none&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e%3ccircle%20cx=&#x27;20&#x27;%20cy=&#x27;20&#x27;%20r=&#x27;20&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;%23E7EDFE&#x27;/%3e%3crect%20x=&#x27;18.125&#x27;%20y=&#x27;16.25&#x27;%20width=&#x27;3.75&#x27;%20height=&#x27;15&#x27;%20rx=&#x27;0.4&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;%231657FC&#x27;/%3e%3ccircle%20cx=&#x27;2.5&#x27;%20cy=&#x27;2.5&#x27;%20r=&#x27;2.5&#x27;%20transform=&#x27;matrix(-1%200%200%201%2022.5%208.75)&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;%231657FC&#x27;/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt=""/></div></div><div class="shortcuts-info-block-between-text shortcuts-info-info-text">Shortcuts settings and changes are stored within the transmitter, enabling them to function when the phone is disconnected.</div></div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="shortcuts-features"></div></div></div><div class="box_block" id="box_block"><div class="box_block-wrap"><div style="opacity:0" class="box_block-top"><div class="box_block-info"><div class="box_block-info-title"><span class="box_block-info-title-what">What’s</span> in the box</div><div class="box_block-info-description">In the box, you will find a Screenmate Dash transmitter and everything you need to install it, as well as a holder for placing the phone where you are used to seeing the car dashboard.</div></div><div class="image box_block-image"><img class="object-cover" draggable="false" src="{{ 'react-box-image-desktop-DqezMSLm.png' | asset_url }}" srcSet="/react-box-image-retina-W2mGqjUW.png 2x" alt="" 